ect.\n\n## For the next owner\nFix P1–P3 first: move the N3/N4 fixes into the claude adapter, ideally by sharing one detection function, and update `test_other_error_false`. Then add session-path tests for the same records (Q2). After that, Q1, Q3, Q4.\n\n## Not done\n`rm -rf /tmp/r22-review /tmp/r22-aside /tmp/r22-tools` was blocked by an approval prompt because the paths are outside the working folder, so I left them. `/tmp/r22-review` holds a full copy of the repo (including `.aimem/aimem.db`), without `.aimem/tls`, `.aimem/runs` or `.aimem/sessions`. Someone with permission should run that command. `git status` shows the same three modified files as when I started, plus `rounds/R22/`, which was already untracked."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":456,"cache_read_input_tokens":134191,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":456},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"993bd581-83cc-4fe7-9c8c-395ae426eb05","uuid":"1852cd0f-4551-4ebe-af9c-0a4e8a2ac1c3","timestamp":"2026-11-12T14:52:31.780Z","request_id":"req_011CgyDtoHDC5G1ifiKcUbX5"}
